## Honest patterns
- "I would not promise lift. I would promise a measurement protocol."
- "The first KPI is whether the user opens the tool twice."
- "Repeatability across clients is the platform test, not feature richness."

## Anti-patterns
- Do not list features. Name the decision the feature unblocks.
- Do not invent ROI numbers without an experiment.
- Do not confuse pilot success with platform readiness.

